  DTS:Description="Nightly customer master synchronisation from the ERP. Runs ahead of the main nightly load so that the regional customer dimensions and the customer-360 mart see the same ERP snapshot; the three regional dimension loads run as separate streams because each region applies its own consent and retention rules."
